					<Color>-16777216</Color>
					<Text><![CDATA[In this simulation a generic business process is modeled with te MAPE-K ELV CRP model.
For each cycle per agent the control cycle is activated. With this control cycle, the
agent can finetune its behavior to optimize the process in the long run. By activating ELV, the learning
capability is activated. When CRP is activated, the knowledge exchange between agents in trust groups is ativted]]></Text>
